  "description": "Virtual stores over PO.DAAC MUR-JPL-L4-GLOB-v4.1 from two producers. VEDA: Icechunk experiments with daily append branches named add_time_<timestamp> (three generations, 2025-04-26 to 2025-10-19; v2-p2 is the newest and is the default here) and a 2024-03-19 Kerchunk set (1.16 GB JSON and a Parquet directory) whose provenance is undocumented. PO.DAAC: the legacy first-decade Kerchunk reference set advertised in CMR. All manifests are anonymous; chunks need Earthdata Login.\n\nStatus (probed 2026-11-06): Experimental (VEDA Icechunk); Legacy (Kerchunk sets).",
